category: Text
build-depends: cygport libfolia-devel libfrog-devel libicu-devel libticcutils-devel libtimbl-devel libucto-devel libxml2-devel
sdesc: "Analysis tool for dutch texts (utilities)"
ldesc: "T-Scan is an analysis tool for dutch texts to assess the complexity of the
text, and is based on original work by Rogier Kraf (Utrecht University) (see:
Kraf et al., 2009). The code has been reimplemented and extended by Ko van der
Sloot (Tilburg University), and is currently maintained and continued by
Martijn van der Klis (Utrecht University)."
skip:

